    "body": "Hi,\n\nI updated my packages lately to:\n\n- django-filter 25.2\n- django-crispy-forms 2.6\n- crispy-bootstrap5 2026.3\n\nWhen I opened an api endpoint and pressed the filter button the modal showed up, however there was no submit-button rendered.\n\nTo solve the problem I overwrote `templates/django_filters/rest_framework/crispy_form.html`  like this:\n\n{```\n% load i18n %}\n<h2>{% trans \"Field filters\" %}</h2>\n<form class=\"form\" action=\"\" method=\"get\">\n    {{ filter.form.as_p }}\n    <button type=\"submit\" class=\"btn btn-primary\">{% trans \"Submit\" %}</button>\n</form>\n```",
