    "body": "Currently the BaseInFilter expects the param to be a csv string like:\n```\n/api/endpoint?listParam=a,b,c\n```\n\nHowever, the standard for list params used by Django QueryDict, JavaScript URLSearchParams, and html forms seems to be to repeat the query param like:\n```\n/api/endpoint?listParam=a&listParam=b&listParam=c\n```\n\nWould it be possible to add support for the repeat query param format via a setting or some config?",
